                "title": "AI Report Generator",
                "model": "",
                "prompt": "You are a weekly business report generator. Using the provided stock data and recent news, generate a concise weekly summary.\n\nOutput ONLY a valid JSON object:\n{\n  \"reportTitle\": \"Weekly Business Report\",\n  \"generatedDate\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"stockSummary\": {\n    \"symbol\": \"...\",\n    \"currentPrice\": \"...\",\n    \"trend\": \"UP|DOWN|STABLE\"\n  },\n  \"newsHighlights\": [\"highlight 1\", \"highlight 2\"],\n  \"overallOutlook\": \"short paragraph summarizing the week\",\n  \"keyMetrics\": {\n    \"stocksTracked\": 1,\n    \"newsArticlesAnalyzed\": N\n  }\n}\n\nDo NOT include any explanations or markdown outside the JSON.",
